{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In the direction of the wind...",
                "It leads in here."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But this is that town full of trastorned rabbits."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're intervining with my Chores.",
                "Maybe you should just head home."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ordinary Maiden Bunny",
                "Maria Bellerose"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just wandering around.",
                "How is that intervining with your chores?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ya know.",
                "All that shooting messing with the decorations."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can just re-decorate."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ay well.",
                "Like if it's that easy."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those plushies were attacking like crazy too."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "you gotta scold them too then."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You also got a lot more rabbits to help you with that.",
                "Bunch of weird-ass rabbits like you."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For a high-schooler",
                "You really got some nerves on you."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you gonna do?",
                "Play with those busty cat plushies like a little girl?"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Actually..."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wouldn't mind owning a plushified overlord-",
                "Nice pink hair, red bows are a nice mix in my book."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just shut up."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The environment is starting to feel strange."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "I hope it's not because of beating someone weird in here."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Rabbits here often capture people."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Strange...",
                "They'll probably have some stupid excuse for it.",
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are the chances."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're intervining with my Chores.",
                "Go home or everything it's gonna end for you!"
            ]
        },
        "103_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sadistic Western Rabbit",
                "Maria Bellerose"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, the trastorned rabbit is mad?"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My chores it's to keep the monsters entertained...",
                "So they won't become aggresive, you should care."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't worry!",
                "I have been exterminating monsters since always."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I see...",
                "Maybe transforming you into a doll isn't a bad idea."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh woah, a rabbit",
                "How terrifying..."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh woah, A mega-busty girl.",
                "How terrifying."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't comes good on you."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, I should do that last chore with you.",
                "If ya don't mind."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I do mind."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder how soft a living plushie might be now."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "I must imagine! Poor guys!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even this place is actin' all weird tonight."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Actually, I think people in this town has always been weird."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Weird?",
                "What's the definition of \"weird\" for ya?"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ordinary Maiden Bunny",
                "Maria Bellerose"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I dunno...Dressing like you",
                "And playing around with busty maid dolls. That's weird."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? these dolls?",
                "they were just common animal-people long time ago."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you do necromancy crap!?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you still come to me asking",
                "\"What's the definition of weird for ya?\" "
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't think that's weird.",
                "It's just a cute-funny way to play with your victims."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok you know what...yes whatever."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's normal, see?",
                "I'm not weird at all."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Actually you're just a weirdo for me now."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Atleast you don't try hard to be creepy",
                "That would make you funny."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that I think about it..."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You would look awesome like a full sized cat-plushie.",
                "That's my new idea."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My new idea is getting fried rabbit for dinner",
                "Do ya like it?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yep, people in here are too weird."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Actually, everyone is weird in here. Who Am I kidding?"
            ]
        }
    }
